  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
    - rid: 6120919340060125377
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 524d737709eaff74c9db275b7ab92f00, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Who completed this repair?
    - rid: 8042311634775731771
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: I did. Mostly.
    - rid: 9099343133674554848
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2757966820b1c56408bfbbd8d30dd10f, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: I prevented two minor disasters.
    - rid: 8828986327991399211
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: One minor disaster.
    - rid: 4100759809726305538
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2757966820b1c56408bfbbd8d30dd10f, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: The second one was prevented. That is why you did not notice it.
    - rid: 3905629312159025480
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: And you are?
    - rid: 1864311164227480864
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ad4a74f0f2261874b962f568ba22424d, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Theo Grant. The best restoration carpenter in town and the worst person
          at introducing himself.
    - rid: 8972867308361887502
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 524d737709eaff74c9db275b7ab92f00, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: I prefer introductions with useful information.
    - rid: 941204066044382698
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 524d737709eaff74c9db275b7ab92f00, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: This house has good bones.
    - rid: 4738567328563758760
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Is that useful information or a compliment?
    - rid: 1628426118786488760
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 524d737709eaff74c9db275b7ab92f00, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Useful information.
    - rid: 2374289015574617124
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 524d737709eaff74c9db275b7ab92f00, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Keep the coffee coming, and I will help you preserve those bones.
    - rid: 4525449205104203081
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Deal.
